        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Our experience with John's was nothing short of incredible. Shawn did an awesome job asking the right questions and evaluating our home to get us into the right HVAC unit for us. Justin and his team made the install look easy! No AC in the summer is a nightmare, but John's was able to come out same day to review our home and the new AC was installed less than 48hrs later. Great communication, timely service, and transparent selling. Can't recommend them enough!",
