      {
        "author": "Jacque Boyd",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Chris Moody from Precision Air & Plumbing did a fantastic job servicing my AC today. He was very professional, knowledgeable, and took the time to clearly explain what my system needed to run more efficiently.\n\nHe installed a soft start to help reduce the strain on my unit, which I really appreciated — you can tell he’s focused on long-term performance, not just a quick service. He walked me through everything in a way that was easy to understand and made sure I felt confident about how my system is running.\n\nGreat experience and great customer service. I highly recommend Chris and Precision A",
        "relativeTime": "3 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "christi mohney",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": "I have been a loyal customer of precision for many years. we were talked in to the vent cleaning service and I'm sad to say the amount of dust, drywall and paint that was knocked off in and around our vents will cause me hours of cleaning and repainting. they also left their taeps up in some places. these are just a few photos",
        "relativeTime": "7 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Charles Timmerman",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": "install went well. we asked to reroute the condensation line from running across the roof  into a vent. we were told...no problem.👌\n\nthe cleanup was was not what we expected.\nthe unit...duct work and insulation were piled onto the street. we live on a fairly severe curve and when it started to get dark...we were worried that someone might run into the mess.\nwe called just before 5:00 and felt better after being told cleanup was running late...but when it got dark we moved a car in front of the pile.\n\na little after 7:30 a young man showed up. never came to the house to say he was here or that",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Desiree Needham",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Precision Air & Plumbing truly went above and beyond for us. From start to finish, they took great care of our home and delivered a fantastic installation with real attention to detail. You can tell they take pride in their work.\n\nOur technician, Ivan, was outstanding. He was professional, knowledgeable, respectful of our space, and took the time to make sure everything was done right. He explained things clearly, worked carefully, and left everything clean and organized. It’s rare to find that level of care these days, and Ivan absolutely represents the company well.\n\nWe couldn’t be happier w",
        "relativeTime": "5 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "Missy Quinones",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I had a great experience with Leslie Cintron who came out for my air-conditioning check. She was extremely knowledgeable and took the time to clearly explain everything in a way that was easy to understand. She was pleasant, professional, and very thorough in her work. I especially appreciated that she put on shoe protectors as soon as she entered the house such a thoughtful and respectful touch. She did an excellent job, and I truly enjoyed her visit. Highly recommend!  Thanks Leslie",
        "relativeTime": "4 months ago"
      },
      {
        "author": "James Dennis",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "Ok, I’m from Alaska and AC is not a thing. I have had several people out and they all said - it’s fine. I got these guys and they identified and fixed the problems. Yes - problems. The service seems pricey but if I had just called them first - it would have been corrected faster and less expensive in the end. The workers were knowledgeable, kind and respectful. They provided a wealth of information and didn’t attempt to fabricate or embellish on what was or was not needed. Great work from professionals.\n1. Ductwork redirecting\n2. Surge protector installed\n3. Slow start system installed\n4. Fill",
        "relativeTime": "9 months ago"
      }
