        "text": "I've been a loyal customer of Hendel's for over 15 years. Over the years they've handled routine maintenance, repaired issues quickly when they came up, and replaced both of our air conditioning units with zero hassle. Their technicians are always knowledgeable, respectful of our home, show up on time, explain everything clearly, and stand behind their work.No high-pressure sales, just honest advice, fair pricing, and top-notch service every single time.  I would definitely recommend Hendel's A/C",
