        "author": "Letty Magallanes",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": "I’m finally writing this review after I’ve had their services for over a year\nI selected this company based on prior reviews, and I was not disappointed. I was actually very impressed that everything I read was true plus more. The kindness and transparency with any interactions I’ve had with this company go unmatched. Their honesty and commitment to customer service is top-notch. Trevor has been nothing short of amazing. Taking the time to explain what’s being done and why is appreciated. He’s not here just to make a buck but instead gaining that trust and customer loyalty.\nI recommend these s",
