        "rating": 5,
        "text": "True North Air is a great company for your HVAC needs. From the moment you call to make an appointment to the minute the technician leaves your house, they’re top-notch all the way around. Jacob was our technician and did an excellent job quickly fixing our issue. Also important is the accurate pricing. It’s refreshing to see an honest company doing things the right way when there are many companies out there trying to gouge their clients. I recommend True North for their great customer service, knowledgeable technicians and fair pricing.",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
