        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We’ve had our routine HVAC system and, once again, the tech tried to sell us some repair we had already done. I called True North for a second opinion and they were great. Not only were they transparent with us (none of the “recommended” repairs were needed) they actually repaired an issue we’ve had for years.\n\nVery friendly and trustworthy. I highly recommend giving them a call.",
        "relativeTime": "6 months ago"
